# Stable SSH host keys (test-only, generated, not committed)

```bash
./scripts/generate-host-keys.sh
```

Baked into the image on `--build` so container recreate does not trigger
"REMOTE HOST IDENTIFICATION HAS CHANGED". Re-run only when you want new host
keys (then clear stale `known_hosts` entries for the lab ports).

INSECURE — do not reuse outside this lab.
